==============================================================================
Part 2 - PPGCosmo Logo Usage Terms
==============================================================================

Applies to: the PPGCosmo logo design (the galaxy symbol together with the
"PPGCosmo" lettering), all files in the images/ folder, ppgcosmologo-demo.pdf,
and any image of the logo produced with the code in Part 1.

The PPGCosmo logo was designed by Davi C. Rodrigues and is the official logo
of the Programa de Pos-Graduacao em Astrofisica, Cosmologia e Gravitacao
(PPGCosmo) of the Universidade Federal do Espirito Santo (UFES), Brazil.
Its use is managed by the PPGCosmo coordination.

All rights reserved, except as granted below.

1. Permitted use

   Anyone may use the logo, free of charge, to identify or refer to PPGCosmo,
   for example in:
     - theses, dissertations and other academic work by PPGCosmo students,
       alumni, faculty and collaborators;
     - scientific papers, talks, posters and slides;
     - websites, news and social-media posts about the programme;
     - materials of events organised or supported by PPGCosmo;
     - institutional documents of PPGCosmo and UFES.

2. Conditions

   When using the logo you must:
     - use one of the official variants: the image files in images/, or the
       output of \ppgcosmologo with its default font and outline settings,
       in any of the provided combinations of version, fontcolor and
       background;
     - scale it proportionally only, without stretching, distorting,
       rotating, cropping, recolouring or rearranging its elements;
     - not add elements to it, nor combine it with other logos or marks in a
       way that forms a new composite mark.

   The "font" and "outline width" options of ppgcosmologo.sty exist for
   technical fallback (for example, when Open Sans is not installed). Logos
   produced with non-default values of these options must not be presented
   as the official PPGCosmo logo.

3. Uses that require prior written permission

   The following require prior written permission from the PPGCosmo
   coordination:
     - any commercial use, including merchandise and products for sale;
     - any use that states or suggests endorsement, sponsorship or official
       participation by PPGCosmo or UFES where there is none;
     - modified or derived versions of the logo;
     - use of the logo, or of elements of it, in another logo or trademark.

   Contact: PPGCosmo coordination, pos.cosmo@ufes.br.

4. General

   These terms may be updated, and the logo may be revised, by the PPGCosmo
   coordination. Permission to use the logo does
   not transfer any copyright or other right in it. The logo is provided
   "as is", without warranty of any kind.
